...", "source": "Ridgewells Catering"}, {"fragment": "Together, we do more. We combine our individual talents to not just impress our clients, but also to inspire each other, elevate our industry, and lift up our community.", "source": "Ridgewells Catering"}, {"fragment": "Rooted in Wisconsin, we create lasting memories through thoughtful hospitality powered by our passionate team.", "source": "Tall Guy and a Grill"}, {"fragment": "Creating lasting memories through heartfelt hospitality, local partnerships, and commitment to sustainability.", "source": "Tall Guy and a Grill (Mission)"}, {"fragment": "We lead with boldness, combining creativity, flexibility, and passion to exceed expectations in every interaction.", "source": "Tall Guy and a Grill (Be Brazen Value)"}, {"fragment": "From whom we hire, to the food we prepare, we believe that diversity is essential to creating the best team, the best company, as well as the best food.", "source": "Relish Catering"}, {"fragment": "Our commitment to caring for people starts first with our 'Relish Family,' because they are the heart of Relish.", "source": "Relish Catering"}, {"fragment": "We're always on the lookout for talented professionals who take food and hospitality really seriously, are excited to learn and grow, and want to have fun along the way!", "source": "Radish (MyRadish)"}, {"fragment": "Flawless events don't happen by chance. Our team of hospitality experts specializes in creating chef-driven experiences...", "source": "SaltBlock Hospitality"}], "team_descriptions": [{"description": "Wolfgang Puck Catering is the best in the industry for a reason; Innovative cuisine, refined service, welcoming warmth, and most importantly, our team members.", "source": "Wolfgang Puck", "quote": '"I can have the best food, but if we don\'t have good people, it won\'t get you very far." - Chef Wolfgang Puck'}, {"description": "A diverse company of passionate party people who love what they do, are ambitious and take risks.", 